    "title": "bench: `WalletLoadingDescriptors` slowdown",
    "body": "Locally running this takes ~180s:\n```bash\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WalletEncryptDescriptors                      | ✓ Passed  | 3 s\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WalletIsMineDescriptors                       | ✓ Passed  | 1 s\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WalletIsMineMigratedDescriptors               | ✓ Passed  | 2 s\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WalletLoadingDescriptors                      | ✓ Passed  | 186 s\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WalletMigration                               | ✓ Passed  | 6 s\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WriteBlockBench                               | ✓ Passed  | 0 s\n```\nLooks like it's also slowed down in the CI, compared to all other benches (which avg ~0s): https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/38328088251/job/115071335648#step:9:4651:\n```bash\n\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WalletEncryptDescriptors                      | ✓ Passed  | 1 s\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WalletIsMineDescriptors                       | ✓ Passed  | 0 s\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WalletIsMineMigratedDescriptors               | ✓ Passed  | 0 s\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WalletLoadingDescriptors                      | ✓ Passed  | 17 s\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WalletMigration                               | ✓ Passed  | 1 s\ntool_bench_sanity_check.py --bench=WriteBlockBench                               | ✓ Passed  | 0 s\n\n```",
